      "html": "<p>這六份 Notebook 使用原創合成資料，學生只需依序執行、修改標示參數並解釋輸出；課程不評量 Python 語法。首次使用請選擇 <strong>Open in Colab</strong>，登入 Google 帳號後另存副本至自己的雲端硬碟。</p>\n<div class=\"concept-box\">\n  <h4 class=\"callout-title\">資料與執行方式</h4>\n  <div class=\"callout-body\"><p>Notebook 會先尋找本機 <code>data/public/</code>，找不到時才讀取 GitHub raw URL。若網站尚未發布，請由教師提供 repo ZIP 或等待 <code>main</code> branch 上線。兩份資料均為固定 seed 的虛構教學資料，不含真實學生資訊。</p>\n  </div>\n</div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Lab</th>\n<th>用途與主要產出</th>\n<th>使用資料</th>\n<th>開啟</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>01 · Data Questions</td>\n<td>辨認觀察單位、變數型態與可回答的探究問題</td>\n<td>晨間作息問卷</td>\n<td><a href=\"colab/lab-01-data-questions.ipynb\">檢視 Notebook</a>{.btn .btn-outline-primary} <a href=\"https://colab.research.google.com/github/johnnychao/statistics-in-context-bilingual/blob/main/labs/colab/lab-01-data-questions.ipynb\">Open in Colab</a>{.btn .btn-primary target=&quot;_blank&quot;}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>02 · Categorical Data</td>\n<td>建立次數、比例與有情境的長條圖</td>\n<td>晨間作息問卷</td>\n<td><a href=\"colab/lab-02-categorical-data.ipynb\">檢視 Notebook</a>{.btn .btn-outline-primary} <a href=\"https://colab.research.google.com/github/johnnychao/statistics-in-context-bilingual/blob/main/labs/colab/lab-02-categorical-data.ipynb\">Open in Colab</a>{.btn .btn-primary target=&quot;_blank&quot;}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>03 · Distributions</td>\n<td>描述 shape、center、variability 與 unusual features</td>\n<td>晨間作息問卷</td>\n<td><a href=\"colab/lab-03-distributions.ipynb\">檢視 Notebook</a>{.btn .btn-outline-primary} <a href=\"https://colab.research.google.com/github/johnnychao/statistics-in-context-bilingual/blob/main/labs/colab/lab-03-distributions.ipynb\">Open in Colab</a>{.btn .btn-primary target=&quot;_blank&quot;}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>04 · Summary &amp; Comparisons</td>\n<td>比較 mean／median、SD／IQR 與群組箱形圖</td>\n<td>晨間作息問卷</td>\n<td><a href=\"colab/lab-04-summary-comparisons.ipynb\">檢視 Notebook</a>{.btn .btn-outline-primary} <a href=\"https://colab.research.google.com/github/johnnychao/statistics-in-context-bilingual/blob/main/labs/colab/lab-04-summary-comparisons.ipynb\">Open in Colab</a>{.btn .btn-primary target=&quot;_blank&quot;}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>05 · Sampling Bias</td>\n<td>比較 SRS、分層抽樣與自願回覆偏誤</td>\n<td>晨間作息問卷</td>\n<td><a href=\"colab/lab-05-sampling-bias.ipynb\">檢視 Notebook</a>{.btn .btn-outline-primary} <a href=\"https://colab.research.google.com/github/johnnychao/statistics-in-context-bilingual/blob/main/labs/colab/lab-05-sampling-bias.ipynb\">Open in Colab</a>{.btn .btn-primary target=&quot;_blank&quot;}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>06 · Experimental Design</td>\n<td>辨認隨機分派、控制、重複與區集，界定因果結論</td>\n<td>晨間介入試驗</td>\n<td><a href=\"colab/lab-06-experimental-design.ipynb\">檢視 Notebook</a>{.btn .btn-outline-primary} <a href=\"https://colab.research.google.com/github/johnnychao/statistics-in-context-bilingual/blob/main/labs/colab/lab-06-experimental-design.ipynb\">Open in Colab</a>{.btn .btn-primary target=&quot;_blank&quot;}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>每份 Lab 的完成證據</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>執行所有儲存格且通過綠色 <code>Checks passed</code>。</li>\n<li>完成至少一項「✏️ 修改任務」，保留修改後的輸出。</li>\n<li>依 AP English Response frame 撰寫統計情境解釋。</li>\n<li>回答課堂 Lab 檢核題；不要只繳交程式畫面。</li>\n</ol>\n<blockquote>\n<p>本教材為獨立製作的課程伴讀資源，未獲 College Board 認可或背書。AP® 為 College Board 的註冊商標。</p>\n</blockquote>\n"
